{
  "_about": [
    "Feat loop batch 1, lane b1-spellhooks (2026-11-22): the feats that change how a spell's",
    "numbers come out, read through the spell's own roll context (casting.spell_context:",
    "school, subschool, spell, energy, descriptor) at the save DC (spell_dc), the caster",
    "level it is cast at (spell_cl, casting.spell_caster_level), the check against spell",
    "resistance and concentration. Teamwork clauses ask `ally_adjacent`. The metamagic",
    "feats are in metamagic.json. Text read on aonprd.com FeatDisplay pages 2026-11-22."
  ],
  "elemental-focus": {
    "modifiers": [
      {
        "type": "combat_mod",
